Rural.text:
Note: The rural consumer confidence survey covers both rural and semi-urban areas.
Up to May 2024, figures are based on 26 states/ UTs; from July 2024, figures are compiled based on 31 states/ UTs; 
‘Net response’ is the difference between the percentage of respondents reporting optimism and those reporting pessimisms. It ranges between -100 and 100. Any value greater than zero indicates expansion/ optimism and values less than zero indicate contraction/ pessimism.

